<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ā^phrŏdīsĭăs</span></b> ,
			ădis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αφροδισιάς</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A region in Asiatic Æolis</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 37,
			21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 30, 32, §
			122</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A town and promontory in Caria</i>, <i>on the Mœander</i>, now <i>Geira</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				5, 28, 29, § 104</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>An island near Gades</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 22,
				36, § 120</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>An island in the Persian Gulf</i>, now <i>Kaish</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 25, 28, §
		111</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
